No Longer Supported SimTalk Names of the 2D Visualization
Previous versions of Plant Simulation provided SimTalk attributes, SimTalk read-only attributes and
SimTalk methods referring to the 2D visualization, which we do not support any more.
The command Find Outdated Functions on the tab Debugger finds all outdated functions in your model
and shows them in a window.
Plant Simulation shows outdated functions in the source code in this color 
 .
